flowchart TD
A([Next document, in order D1, D2, ...]) --> B{Extraction status}
B -->|present| P1{Usable comparison key?}
P1 -->|no| M[lifecycle: missing<br/>never guess]
P1 -->|yes| P2{Which rule governs now?}
P2 -->|"'no such provision'"| PA[lifecycle: amended<br/>provision added<br/>earlier N/A superseded]
P2 -->|none yet| PU[lifecycle: unchanged<br/>this becomes governing]
P2 -->|a rule, same key| PU2[lifecycle: unchanged]
P2 -->|a rule, different key| PM[lifecycle: amended<br/>earlier unchanged superseded<br/>this becomes governing]
B -->|missing = silent| S1{Governing rule or N/A?}
S1 -->|rule| SC[Carry value forward<br/>status present, unchanged<br/>carriedForward trace]
S1 -->|N/A| SN[Carry N/A forward<br/>keep naBasis]
S1 -->|nothing| SM[lifecycle: missing]
B -->|notApplicable| N1{Document read AND<br/>affirmative evidence?}
N1 -->|yes| NA[lifecycle: notApplicable<br/>earlier rule superseded]
N1 -->|no| S1
B -->|ambiguous| AM[lifecycle: missing<br/>needs explicit review]
